usage: check_original_program_scope.py [-h] --root ROOT --catalog CATALOG
                                       --ledger LEDGER [--output OUTPUT]

Fail-closed review gate for all 183 original-program scopes. This validates
explicit substantive reviews and their exact source/proof bindings. It does
not infer semantic coverage from compilation, existing task labels, or hashes,
and it never treats pending work as numerical deferral.

options:
  -h, --help         show this help message and exit
  --root ROOT
  --catalog CATALOG
  --ledger LEDGER
  --output OUTPUT
